/* ----------------------------------------------------------- ALLEY ZONES ----
   Eleven workable zones. AZ01-AZ10 are the merged alley shape above cut into
   one zone per block area — A, B, C, E & F, P, CAFS, NTEP, Ornamentals, the
   Sports Field and the buildings — and together they tile it exactly (10.02
   acres). Zone edges fall halfway between two blocks' plots, which is where a
   person would stop mowing anyway. A zone can be claimed, worked and checked
   off on its own, so two people never take the same ground.

   AZ11 (CAFS alleyways) was added later and is NOT part of that merge: it is
   gravel ground the original alley polygon never covered, which is why the
   eleven zones total 11.48 acres against a 10.02-acre alley shape. Gravel is
   sprayable, not mowable, but it stays in the rotation because the rotation is
   about covering ground, not about cutting it.

   Generated by tools/make-alley-zones.py — edit there, not here. */
